  "description": "Somyi loses her lover, Maru, and lives a hopeless life ahead of her wedding. Then, a mysterious shaman, Yeon-hwa, appears in front of her.\n\n'Kang Maru, do you want to see him again?'\n\nWith the power of her softening, Somyi returns to her past four years ago overnight, but... A completely different Maru appears in front of Somyi, and everything goes wrong for Somyi, who returns to her past, one year earlier before her and Maru originally met.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=813097), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=9929667)",
